14
00:00:50,937 --> 00:00:52,880
that led to the fraud's unraveling.

15
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:56,838
The earliest documented institutional
warnings about Bernard L.

16
00:00:56,838 --> 00:01:01,487
Madoff Investment Securities came from
outside investigators who could not

17
00:01:01,487 --> 00:01:04,565
reconcile the stated returns with market
