18
00:01:04,565 --> 00:01:08,722
Harry Markopolos, a financial analyst,
spent years submitting detailed

19
00:01:08,722 --> 00:01:13,056
mathematical analyses to the Boston
regional office of the Securities and

20
00:01:13,056 --> 00:01:17,331
Exchange Commission, arguing that Madoff's
