24
00:01:28,326 --> 00:01:29,419
trading strategy.

25
00:01:29,419 --> 00:01:34,504
According to multiple SEC Office of
Inspector General reports, investigators

26
00:01:34,504 --> 00:01:39,589
examined the complaints but routinely
