28
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:45,744
counterparties.

29
00:01:45,744 --> 00:01:51,188
The SEC relied on Madoff's self-reporting
and superficial document reviews rather

30
00:01:51,188 --> 00:01:55,960
than independent data verification,
demonstrating a systemic failure in

31
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,581
regulatory enforcement during that era.

32
00:01:58,581 --> 00:02:03,489
The Office of Inspector General's report,
published in 2009, detailed hundreds of

33
00:02:03,489 --> 00:02:08,397
pages of internal SEC communications and
