40
00:02:32,515 --> 00:02:34,248
operation for nearly a decade.

41
00:02:34,248 --> 00:02:38,944
The intervention that finally broke the
enterprise was not an auditor's

42
00:02:38,944 --> 00:02:44,103
spreadsheet, but a severe liquidity
shortage triggered by market conditions in

43
00:02:44,103 --> 00:02:45,360
