48
00:03:03,442 --> 00:03:04,240
in late 2008.

49
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:09,328
The firm's bank accounts, primarily held
at JPMorgan Chase, held only a fraction of

50
00:03:09,328 --> 00:03:14,110
that sum because no actual legitimate
trading had occurred for years; incoming

51
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:19,260
