61
00:03:55,072 --> 00:03:59,467
On the evening of December 9, 2008,
according to Department of Justice

62
00:03:59,467 --> 00:04:04,240
charging documents, Bernard Madoff
summoned his sons, Mark Madoff and Andrew

63
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,437
Madoff, to his Manhattan apartment.

64
00:04:06,437 --> 00:04:11,441
He informed them that the investment
advisory business, which they believed to

65
00:04:11,441 --> 00:04:16,830
