81
00:05:07,957 --> 00:05:10,012
The criminal complaint, filed in the U.S.

82
00:05:10,012 --> 00:05:13,869
District Court for the Southern District
of New York, details the sequence of

83
00:05:13,869 --> 00:05:17,827
